### APAX API requests
### Use the REST Client extension (VS Code) or import into your HTTP client of choice.
### Run `npm run seed -w server` first for the demo user these assume.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@demoEmail = demo@apax.institutional
@demoPassword = ApaxDemo123!

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### Auth (Task 2A) - mounted at /user (legacy prefix, see README)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Login - success
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{demoEmail}}",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}"
}

### Login - wrong password (same message as unknown email, by design)
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{demoEmail}}",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### Login - unknown email (same message as wrong password, by design)
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@apax.institutional",
  "password": "whatever123"
}

### Login - rate limited after 10 attempts in 15 minutes
# Run the wrong-password request above 10+ times in a row to see this fire.

### Current user (requires the cookie set by /user/login above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/me

### Logout - clears the cookie
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/logout

### Register (legacy - uploads an avatar via Cloudinary, needs real creds)
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New User",
  "email": "newuser@apax.institutional",
  "gender": "unspecified",
  "password": "SomePassword123",
  "avatar": ""
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### Holdings + activity (Task 2B, and Task 1B's data source)
### mounted at /api - the naming the brief asks for directly
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Holdings - 401 with no cookie
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/holdings

### Holdings - 200 with a valid session (run the login request above first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/holdings

### Holdings - 401 with a tampered token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/holdings
Cookie: token=not-a-real-token

### Recent activity - 401 with no cookie
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activity

### Recent activity - 200 with a valid session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activity

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### Legacy demo stubs - unrelated to the gold/silver/platinum
### portfolio, kept as-is under their original paths (see README)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Balance summary (in-memory, resets on server restart)
GET {{baseUrl}}/balance

### Activity - add a deposit
POST {{baseUrl}}/activity/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": "demo",
  "amount": 100
}

### Activity - add a withdrawal
POST {{baseUrl}}/activity/withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": "demo",
  "amount": 50
}
